OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are more towns and cities
OL,4,Amoving to 20mph?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore councils across the UK are
OL,7,Fintroducing 20mph speed limits on
OL,8,Fresidential streets, arguing they save
OL,9,Flives and make communities safer.
OL,11,FCritics say they increase journey
OL,12,Ftimes, add costs for businesses and can
OL,13,Ffrustrate drivers.
OL,15,FAs authorities consider wider rollouts,
OL,16,Fthe debate over whether lower speed
OL,17,Flimits deliver enough benefits
OL,18,Fcontinues.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
