OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are more towns and cities
OL,4,Amoving to 20mph?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales introduced a default 20mph limit
OL,7,Fon most restricted roads in September
OL,8,F2023, while Edinburgh became Scotland's
OL,9,Ffirst city-wide 20mph network.
